  "releaseNotes": "Fixed a CFG009 false negative where a safe same-block assignment or alias stopped being recognized when the host IConfiguration contract was wrapped in a non-user-defined interface conversion. Provenance unwraps only configuration-interface conversions, while mutation rooting conservatively follows any non-user-defined cast; existing local, concrete-custom, mutated, escaped, and captured safety boundaries remain intact.",
